  "Creating token and accounts — the wallet will prompt twice…": "Yn creu tocyn a chyfrifon — bydd y waled yn gofyn ddwywaith…",
  "Not enough Devnet SOL for setup. Request more at faucet.solana.com (setup needs about 0.02 SOL).": "Dim digon o SOL Devnet ar gyfer y gosodiad. Gofynnwch am fwy ar faucet.solana.com (mae angen tua 0.02 SOL ar y gosodiad).",
  "Setup complete. {0} test tokens minted to your account.": "Gosodiad wedi'i gwblhau. Bathwyd {0} tocyn prawf i'ch cyfrif.",
  "Setup failed:": "Methodd y gosodiad:",
  "Running…": "Yn rhedeg…",
  "Not enough Devnet SOL for fees. Request more at faucet.solana.com and try again.": "Dim digon o SOL Devnet ar gyfer ffioedd. Gofynnwch am fwy ar faucet.solana.com a rhowch gynnig arall arni.",
  "Your token account holds {0}, and this flow moves {1}. Run SETUP again to mint a fresh allocation.": "Mae gan eich cyfrif tocyn {0}, ac mae'r llif hwn yn symud {1}. Rhedwch y GOSODIAD eto i fathu dyraniad newydd.",
  "All three steps completed. Every transaction is verifiable on Solscan.": "Mae'r tri cham wedi'u cwblhau. Gellir dilysu pob trafodiad ar Solscan.",
  "A step failed. Completed steps were compensated automatically — each compensation is a real on-chain transaction.": "Methodd cam. Cafodd y camau a gwblhawyd eu digolledu'n awtomatig — mae pob iawndal yn drafodiad go iawn ar y gadwyn.",
