  "PAY BY BANK WIRE": "TALU DRWY DROSGLWYDDIAD BANC",
  "Send the wire from your bank using the details below, and quote the order number in the wire reference / payment details field. Incoming international wires can take 1–5 business days.": "Anfonwch y trosglwyddiad o'ch banc gan ddefnyddio'r manylion isod, a nodwch rif yr archeb ym maes cyfeirnod / manylion y taliad. Gall trosglwyddiadau rhyngwladol sy'n dod i mewn gymryd 1–5 diwrnod busnes.",
  "Wire reference": "Cyfeirnod y trosglwyddiad",
  "PAY BY INTERAC E-TRANSFER": "TALU DRWY INTERAC E-TRANSFER",
  "In your Canadian online banking, send an Interac e-Transfer for the order amount to the email below, and put the order number in the transfer message. Autodeposit is enabled — no security question is needed and the payment is deposited automatically.": "Yn eich bancio ar-lein yng Nghanada, anfonwch Interac e-Transfer am swm yr archeb i'r e-bost isod, a rhowch rif yr archeb yn neges y trosglwyddiad. Mae Autodeposit wedi'i alluogi — does dim angen cwestiwn diogelwch a chaiff y taliad ei adneuo'n awtomatig.",
  "Send to": "Anfon at",
  "Transfer message": "Neges y trosglwyddiad",
  "PAY IN USDT": "TALU MEWN USDT",
  "For your security, USDT deposit addresses are issued per order by email — never published on this website. Click the button below to request the address; we reply with the address and network. Verify the address by email before sending: cryptocurrency transfers cannot be reversed.": "Er eich diogelwch, caiff cyfeiriadau adneuo USDT eu rhoi fesul archeb drwy e-bost — ni chânt byth eu cyhoeddi ar y wefan hon. Cliciwch y botwm isod i ofyn am y cyfeiriad; byddwn yn ymateb gyda'r cyfeiriad a'r rhwydwaith. Dilyswch y cyfeiriad drwy e-bost cyn anfon: ni ellir gwrthdroi trosglwyddiadau arian cripto.",
  "Amount": "Swm",
  "✉ EMAIL US THIS ORDER": "✉ ANFONWCH YR ARCHEB HON ATOM DRWY E-BOST",
  "✉ REQUEST USDT ADDRESS": "✉ GOFYN AM GYFEIRIAD USDT",
  "COPY": "COPÏO",
  "Interac e-Transfer works in Canadian dollars only, so the currency has been switched to CAD. Please enter the amount in CAD.": "Dim ond mewn doleri Canada y mae Interac e-Transfer yn gweithio, felly mae'r arian cyfred wedi'i newid i CAD. Rhowch y swm mewn CAD.",
  "No email app? Send the order details to": "Dim ap e-bost? Anfonwch fanylion yr archeb at",
  "PAY NOW IN YOUR BANK": "TALU NAWR YN EICH BANC",
  "1. Your order number has been copied.": "1. Mae rhif eich archeb wedi'i gopïo.",
  "2. Open your bank below and sign in.": "2. Agorwch eich banc isod a mewngofnodi.",
  "3. Choose Interac e-Transfer → Send money. Recipient: info@cosmosledgerlabs.com. Amount: the order amount. Message: paste the order number.": "3. Dewiswch Interac e-Transfer → Anfon arian. Derbynnydd: info@cosmosledgerlabs.com. Swm: swm yr archeb. Neges: gludwch rif yr archeb.",
  "COPY ORDER NUMBER AGAIN": "COPÏO RHIF YR ARCHEB ETO",
  "Other bank or credit union: open your own online banking or banking app.": "Banc neu undeb credyd arall: agorwch eich bancio ar-lein neu ap eich banc.",
  "Waiting for your e-Transfer. This page updates on its own once the payment is received — you can also close it; your order is saved.": "Yn aros am eich e-Transfer. Mae'r dudalen hon yn diweddaru ei hun pan ddaw'r taliad i law — gallwch hefyd ei chau; mae'ch archeb wedi'i chadw.",
  "PAYMENT RECEIVED ✓ — thank you. A receipt will follow by email.": "TALIAD WEDI'I DDERBYN ✓ — diolch. Bydd derbynneb yn dilyn drwy e-bost.",
