  "COPY ORDER NUMBER": "COPÏO RHIF YR ARCHEB",
  "START A NEW ORDER": "DECHRAU ARCHEB NEWYDD",
  "Questions about your order or payment? Email us and we reply directly:": "Cwestiynau am eich archeb neu'ch taliad? Anfonwch e-bost atom ac fe atebwn yn uniongyrchol:",
  "Generate a payment order and pay COSMOS Ledger Labs Inc. by bank wire, Interac e-Transfer or USDT.": "Crëwch archeb dalu a thalu COSMOS Ledger Labs Inc. drwy drosglwyddiad banc, Interac e-Transfer neu USDT.",
  "Generate a payment order and pay by bank wire, Interac e-Transfer or USDT.": "Crëwch archeb dalu a thalu drwy drosglwyddiad banc, Interac e-Transfer neu USDT.",
  "e.g. Lily": "e.e. Lily",
  "HOW PAYMENT WORKS": "SUT MAE TALU'N GWEITHIO",
  "Project work is performed under a written agreement, with fees fixed in writing before work begins. Technical consulting is charged at the rates published on our Services page. Payment schedules (deposit and milestones, if any) are set out in the agreement, on the invoice, or in the payment order you generate.": "Caiff gwaith prosiect ei wneud o dan gytundeb ysgrifenedig, gyda ffioedd wedi'u pennu'n ysgrifenedig cyn i'r gwaith ddechrau. Codir am gyngor technegol ar y cyfraddau a gyhoeddir ar ein tudalen Gwasanaethau. Caiff amserlenni talu (blaendal a cherrig milltir, os oes rhai) eu nodi yn y cytundeb, ar yr anfoneb, neu yn yr archeb dalu a grëwch.",
  "ACCEPTED PAYMENT METHODS": "DULLIAU TALU A DDERBYNNIR",
  "We accept payment by bank wire transfer, in USDT (stablecoin), and — within Canada — by Interac e-Transfer. For your security, payment details are not displayed publicly on this website: they are provided when you generate a payment order on our Pay page, or on the official invoice you receive from\ninfo@cosmosledgerlabs.com.": "Rydym yn derbyn taliad drwy drosglwyddiad banc, mewn USDT (stablecoin), ac — o fewn Canada — drwy Interac e-Transfer. Er eich diogelwch, nid yw manylion talu'n cael eu dangos yn gyhoeddus ar y wefan hon: cânt eu rhoi pan fyddwch yn creu archeb dalu ar ein tudalen Talu, neu ar yr anfoneb swyddogol a gewch gan\ninfo@cosmosledgerlabs.com.",
  "We never send payment details through chat apps, social media, or unsolicited email.": "Nid ydym byth yn anfon manylion talu drwy apiau sgwrsio, cyfryngau cymdeithasol nac e-bost digymell.",
  "We never ask you to send USDT or any cryptocurrency to a wallet address received in a chat message or social media post. A USDT address is valid only when it is sent from\ninfo@cosmosledgerlabs.com — either in reply to your payment order, or on an official invoice.": "Ni fyddwn byth yn gofyn i chi anfon USDT nac unrhyw arian cripto arall i gyfeiriad waled a gawsoch mewn neges sgwrs neu bostiad ar gyfryngau cymdeithasol. Mae cyfeiriad USDT yn ddilys dim ond pan gaiff ei anfon gan\ninfo@cosmosledgerlabs.com — naill ai mewn ateb i'ch archeb dalu, neu ar anfoneb swyddogol.",
  "Other than fees for our own services, we never receive or hold funds for clients or investors, and we never charge success fees or take a percentage of funds raised.": "Ar wahân i ffioedd am ein gwasanaethau ein hunain, nid ydym byth yn derbyn nac yn dal arian ar ran cleientiaid na buddsoddwyr, ac nid ydym byth yn codi ffioedd llwyddiant nac yn cymryd canran o'r arian a godir.",
  "Valid payment details come from only two places: a payment order you generate yourself on this website, and emails — a reply to your order or an official invoice — sent from\ninfo@cosmosledgerlabs.com.": "Daw manylion talu dilys o ddau le yn unig: archeb dalu a grëwch eich hun ar y wefan hon, ac e-byst — ateb i'ch archeb neu anfoneb swyddogol — a anfonir gan\ninfo@cosmosledgerlabs.com.",
  "Cryptocurrency transfers cannot be reversed — confirm any USDT address with us by email before sending.": "Ni ellir gwrthdroi trosglwyddiadau arian cripto — cadarnhewch unrhyw gyfeiriad USDT gyda ni drwy e-bost cyn anfon.",
  "A payment request from any other source is fraudulent: do not pay, and forward it to info@cosmosledgerlabs.com.": "Mae cais am daliad o unrhyw ffynhonnell arall yn dwyllodrus: peidiwch â thalu, ac anfonwch ef ymlaen at info@cosmosledgerlabs.com.",
  "Payment — COSMOS Ledger Labs": "Talu — COSMOS Ledger Labs",
  "How COSMOS Ledger Labs Inc. invoices and accepts payment, and how to recognise fraudulent payment requests.": "Sut mae COSMOS Ledger Labs Inc. yn anfonebu ac yn derbyn taliad, a sut i adnabod ceisiadau twyllodrus am daliad.",
